    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "champ_0230_system_01",
      "hash64": "6DD6B9F2EFEEE2AA",
      "text": "要挑戰四天王波琵嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "champ_0230_steel_01a",
      "hash64": "7F4D8B6DD0A5AC49",
      "text": "雖然好不容易到了第二輪測驗，\\n但是大哥哥你要在這裡說拜拜囉！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "champ_0230_steel_01b",
      "hash64": "7F4D886DD0A5A730",
      "text": "雖然好不容易到了第二輪測驗，\\n但是大姐姐妳要在這裡說拜拜囉！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0230_steel_02",
      "hash64": "B87B03FC220642BF",
      "text": "因為波琵我的寶可夢們\\n全～都是硬梆梆的！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0230_steel_03",
      "hash64": "B87B02FC2206410C",
      "text": "那種軟～趴趴的攻擊\\n根本就不痛不癢，沒什麼大不了。[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0230_steel_04",
      "hash64": "B87B01FC22063F59",
      "text": "出～來吧！\\n波琵我的好朋友！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0230_steel_05",
      "hash64": "B87B00FC22063DA6",
      "text": "唉啊～唉啊～！\\n波琵我沒能幫辛俐姐姐\\r\\n搬回城堡～[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0230_ground_01",
      "hash64": "82F883171B541B04",
      "text": "是扳回一城喲。\\n真要搬城堡，妳一個人也搬不動的。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0230_ground_02",
      "hash64": "82F886171B54201D",
      "text": "話說，波琵，\\n打輸了就要叫下一個人上場喲。[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0230_steel_06",
      "hash64": "B87AFFFC22063BF3",
      "text": "哎呀～差點忘了～！\\n我好久沒有叫叔叔出來了。[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0230_steel_07",
      "hash64": "B87AFEFC22063A40",
      "text": "叔叔～！輪到你囉～！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "champ_0230_fly_01",
      "hash64": "5F43BC022090A288",
      "text": "……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好，我是青木。[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
